     1057   define buffer buf_temp-smart-link for temp-smart-link.
     1058     do
     1059     on error undo, return error
     1060     :
     1061       run gen-key-rec in this-procedure ( input p-tbl-name
     1062                                          ,input p-bh_tbl-name
     1063                                          ,output v-key-rec     ).
     1064      find first buf_temp-smart-link where
     1065                 buf_temp-smart-link.uniq-key-rec = v-key-rec
     1066              and buf_temp-smart-link.key-field = p-key-field
     1067              and buf_temp-smart-link.rec-ord = p-rec-ord
     1068              no-error .
     1069      if not available buf_temp-smart-link then do:
     1070        create buf_temp-smart-link.
     1071        assign
